'''Thunderblood Greataxe''' is a version of [[Nord Greataxe]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[slash]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo (wide swing, wide swing, vertical overhead) with double damage on the last hit, 1.5x [[staggering]] and no multitarget penalty.
* The faster secondary attack deals 0.5x damage and 4x staggering.

An upgraded Nord Greataxe will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Greataxe.

